OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrisk winds. Rather cloudy with
OL,6,Fbest of limited brighter spells
OL,7,Fexpected during the morning. Most
OL,8,Fstaying dry but some patchy rain
OL,9,Fabout, largely confined to Moray and
OL,10,Fwestern parts of Aberdeenshire.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWindy and cloudy. Rain
OL,13,Ffocused across far west early evening,
OL,14,Fspreading to the rest of the area
OL,15,Fovernight, perhaps turning heavy at
OL,16,Ftimes and to snow over west hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
