OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,6,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest through the day, with these
OL,9,Foutbreaks focused over the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FShowers throughout across most areas,
OL,13,Fbut always drier and brighter towards
OL,14,FDeeside. Temperatures seasonally low
OL,15,Fgiven the generally northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
